8. Recommendations for Improvement
•	Hyperparameter tuning: Try adjusting the regularization strength in Logistic Regression, or experiment with other models like SVMs or Random Forests for better performance.
•	Class Imbalance: Although SMOTE helped balance the dataset, experimenting with class weights in Logistic Regression could further improve the model’s performance.
•	Advanced Techniques: For better understanding and prediction, consider using BERT or GPT-based models for fine-grained sentiment analysis, as these deep learning models often outperform traditional approaches like TF-IDF and GloVe.
9. Conclusion
This project demonstrated that both TF-IDF and GloVe embeddings are effective for sentiment analysis. The Logistic Regression model achieved a solid accuracy of around 77%, with room for improvement through advanced techniques and further tuning.

